  "headline": "Indonesian National Police Investigate Brigadier General In Wiretap",
  "seoTitle": "Indonesia Police Probe General Over Presidential Wiretap",
  "metaDescription": "Indonesian police are investigating a brigadier general following allegations of illegal surveillance targeting President Prabowo Subianto.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "A brigadier general identified by initials TK is currently undergoing questioning by the professional ethics division.",
    "Police leadership has indicated that the directive for the surveillance operation was allegedly issued verbally by Listyo Sigit.",
    "Authorities are actively conducting investigations, including house searches, into the involvement of several named suspects."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police are currently addressing a significant internal investigation involving allegations of illegal surveillance directed at President Prabowo Subianto. Official reports state that the investigation has reached the level of a brigadier general, identified by the initials TK, who is currently being questioned by the professional ethics division, Propam. Furthermore, the National Police Chief has identified Irjen Slamet Uliandi as a suspect, who is currently under house arrest in connection with these activities. Emerging reports indicate that the surveillance orders were allegedly issued verbally by Listyo Sigit, who is further suspected of being the end user of the obtained information. The Corruption Eradication Commission has also acknowledged its involvement in the ongoing legal discourse regarding these security breaches. Various public and professional organizations have publicly responded to the police handling of these sensitive allegations as the investigation continues to unfold.",
